    [{ speaker: 'Narrator', text: `The Echo of Despair dissolved. The garden bloomed. Mira kneeled by the grave, no longer weeping. "Grief is not an end—it is a continuation. Lila is woven into every petal, every note I sing. I will sing for the living now."` }]
